Description: Wayland desktop session where the Quark app is the desktop
 Quark DE is a sway configuration and a POSIX sh launcher. It adds a "Quark"
 entry to the display manager that starts sway with the Quark Flutter app
 fullscreen as the desktop and a browser and a terminal on side workspaces.
 .
 The Quark app itself is not packaged yet: install the Quark Linux app from
 https://github.com/autobutler-org/quark/releases and put "quark" on PATH.
 Run "quark-de --check" to list anything missing.
